  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Trust in compromised eMudhra intermediate CA keys\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115557.patch: in Modules/_ssl.c, install a\n       verify callback on every SSLContext that rejects certificate chains\n       containing a certificate whose SubjectPublicKeyInfo SHA-256 digest\n       is on the new Modules/_ssl/distrusted_spki.h denylist of compromised\n       eMudhra intermediate CA keys (X509_V_ERR_CERT_REJECTED). Backport of\n       upstream af52b41afa43 (gh-160040)\n     - CVE-2026-115557",
